      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "FRONT MAN (1) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.3 lengths away in third (19.15) behind Warrego Rain at this track. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Likely to be in the finish again. BIONIC LANA (8) continues to build a strong record and was impressive winner in quick time last start when scoring by 2 lengths (21.97) at Q Lakeside. Superior out of the boxes and will be in the firing line early. Got the money at her only try from this box. Bold showing expected again. AFFILIATED (7) recorded a win over the 300m at this track in a useful 16.63 last start. Expected to feature again. ROSE OF ALABAMA (2) is always a threat when she races at this journey.",
